         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
               SubframeQualityReview 0.66.6 retries missing Transparency measurements, enlarges sparse corners per group, and uses observing-site profiles to calculate cloud extinction. Draw an object region on the master for rejection recommendations, which can now use matched stars when a brightness measurement is missing. Saved process instances reopen reliably, and equivalent folder paths preserve measurements and pending rejection decisions.
            </p>
